(6399586, 948404, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hope you cleaned off her feet afterwards. I''d suggest spending plenty of time cleaning her feet. Oh, I see some other spots that got dirty. Make sure to clean that off, too.</td>', 'Hope you cleaned off her feet afterwards. I''d suggest spending plenty of time cleaning her feet. Oh, I see some other spots that got dirty. Make sure to clean that off, too.', '2011-05-01 01:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6399587, 947782, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love this location, and your subject is fascinating.  Although I''m not a fan of in-your-face pp''ing, it sort of works for this image, although there is some very weird shadow across her feet (I''m guessing cast by the photog), which keeps drawing my eye to it.  Nothing that couldn''t have been dodged a bit to reduce the darkness.</td>', 'Love this location, and your subject is fascinating.  Although I''m not a fan of in-your-face pp''ing, it sort of works for this image, although there is some very weird shadow across her feet (I''m guessing cast by the photog), which keeps drawing my eye to it.  Nothing that couldn''t have been dodged a bit to reduce the darkness.', '2011-05-01 01:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
