(6399610, 948818, 117534, '<td valign="top">OMG you shouldn''t even be allowed to enter something as beautiful as this! I would have cropped it so the water just showed at the bottom and not the bank. To me the most awesome part if from the water up... The only thing that stopped me from giving it a 10, but it is a 9 in my book any day!</td>', 'OMG you shouldn''t even be allowed to enter something as beautiful as this! I would have cropped it so the water just showed at the bottom and not the bank. To me the most awesome part if from the water up... The only thing that stopped me from giving it a 10, but it is a 9 in my book any day!', '2011-05-01 01:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
