(6399671, 948985, 96751, '<td valign="top">Incredible.  I''m laughing because I traveled with my family to Kenya when I was a kid, and we were the folks in that car!!!  There was just the one bull charging towards us, but it was quite impressive.</td>', 'Incredible.  I''m laughing because I traveled with my family to Kenya when I was a kid, and we were the folks in that car!!!  There was just the one bull charging towards us, but it was quite impressive.', '2011-05-01 01:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6399672, 949036, 96751, '<td valign="top">She is so magnificent.  A pity that the bg competes so fiercely for our attention.</td>', 'She is so magnificent.  A pity that the bg competes so fiercely for our attention.', '2011-05-01 01:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6399673, 948835, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very sweet.  Lovely lighting.</td>', 'Very sweet.  Lovely lighting.', '2011-05-01 01:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6399675, 949022, 96751, '<td valign="top">The colors are truly spectacular.  But I feel that there is too much extraneous activity, and that the leftmost person (and a bit of the foreground) could easily have been cropped down to focus more on the interesting parts.</td>', 'The colors are truly spectacular.  But I feel that there is too much extraneous activity, and that the leftmost person (and a bit of the foreground) could easily have been cropped down to focus more on the interesting parts.', '2011-05-01 01:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6399676, 949082, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''m curious why you chose to selectively desaturate some of the colors. Usually when someone does this it''s to isolate something or bring attention to something particular in the photo. In this case I''d assume the subject is the squirrel, but you''ve chose to leave the yellow and red coloring that leads me to the lines behind him; in effect distracting from the subject.</td>', 'I''m curious why you chose to selectively desaturate some of the colors. Usually when someone does this it''s to isolate something or bring attention to something particular in the photo. In this case I''d assume the subject is the squirrel, but you''ve chose to leave the yellow and red coloring that leads me to the lines behind him; in effect distracting from the subject.', '2011-05-01 01:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6399677, 948732, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very interesting juxtapositions.</td>', 'Very interesting juxtapositions.', '2011-05-01 01:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
