(6401572, 948866, 124875, '<td valign="top">The idea is good, but: 1) you should have caught her feet, too; 2) I imagine that her expression is concentrated because of the world''s weight, but I would have liked it different, i.e. with her eyes opened, or grinding her teeth. In any case, something that capture the viewer''s attention.</td>', 'The idea is good, but: 1) you should have caught her feet, too; 2) I imagine that her expression is concentrated because of the world''s weight, but I would have liked it different, i.e. with her eyes opened, or grinding her teeth. In any case, something that capture the viewer''s attention.', '2011-05-02 10:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
