(6403581, 948333, 108580, '<td valign="top">Very cute, image is off centre and despite the obvious vignette, very soft. Pity you failed to crop it square :)</td>', 'Very cute, image is off centre and despite the obvious vignette, very soft. Pity you failed to crop it square :)', '2011-05-04 01:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
