(6403599, 945334, 41337, '<td valign="top">An arresting image. Maybe a bit too much of a tight crop but I do like where the faces are. Also, probably should have darkened that lower left corner since her leg serves no purpose in this shot except as a possible distraction.</td>', 'An arresting image. Maybe a bit too much of a tight crop but I do like where the faces are. Also, probably should have darkened that lower left corner since her leg serves no purpose in this shot except as a possible distraction.', '2011-05-04 02:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
