(6403697, 948820, 106484, '<td valign="top">Very nice, although the background is way too busy. This would have been perfect with a larger aperture to blur out the background. But i''m guessing this is a long telephoto and is at its full aperture.</td>', 'Very nice, although the background is way too busy. This would have been perfect with a larger aperture to blur out the background. But i''m guessing this is a long telephoto and is at its full aperture.', '2011-05-04 04:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
