(6403797, 948859, 128323, '<td valign="top">Love the shot, not loving the border.  7.</td>', 'Love the shot, not loving the border.  7.', '2011-05-04 08:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6403798, 946528, 128323, '<td valign="top">Was this with a lensbaby?  I like the selective focus.</td>', 'Was this with a lensbaby?  I like the selective focus.', '2011-05-04 08:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6403801, 948566, 128323, '<td valign="top">Great action shot--a tighter crop would have been nice</td>', 'Great action shot--a tighter crop would have been nice', '2011-05-04 08:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6403802, 944461, 128323, '<td valign="top">This looks like an awesome location for a good shot.  My suggestion is that you go back, find a time with a better sky, find a way to get the chain link fence and the cars out of the shot, and don''t cut off the antenna at the top of the pic.  Also, since it''s a lighthouse, it would be cool to see some ocean in the background.</td>', 'This looks like an awesome location for a good shot.  My suggestion is that you go back, find a time with a better sky, find a way to get the chain link fence and the cars out of the shot, and don''t cut off the antenna at the top of the pic.  Also, since it''s a lighthouse, it would be cool to see some ocean in the background.', '2011-05-04 08:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6403804, 948858, 128323, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but it looks way over-processed.  It would have looked better if you didn''t overcook the sky in the way you did.  The fact that the sky is bright around the trees is distracting, because it shows me that you did some kind of layer mask or burn on the center part of the sky.  I think if you tried again with the RAW file (if you have one), and went a little more subtle, you''d be happy with the results.</td>', 'I like this shot, but it looks way over-processed.  It would have looked better if you didn''t overcook the sky in the way you did.  The fact that the sky is bright around the trees is distracting, because it shows me that you did some kind of layer mask or burn on the center part of the sky.  I think if you tried again with the RAW file (if you have one), and went a little more subtle, you''d be happy with the results.', '2011-05-04 08:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6403805, 946580, 117037, '<td valign="top">Cool...painting on canvas.</td>', 'Cool...painting on canvas.', '2011-05-04 08:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6403806, 949016, 128323, '<td valign="top">nice tonal range!</td>', 'nice tonal range!', '2011-05-04 08:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6403807, 946526, 117037, '<td valign="top">Impressive</td>', 'Impressive', '2011-05-04 08:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
