(6404055, 949022, 91783, '<td valign="top">I''d be interest to see what the final product was of the other photographer. :)</td>', 'I''d be interest to see what the final product was of the other photographer. :)', '2011-05-04 12:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404150, 948353, 118154, '<td valign="top">Has a real classic look,love it.</td>', 'Has a real classic look,love it.', '2011-05-04 13:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404223, 948928, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like there may be a story here, but the entire image comes off to me as so fuzzy and blurry, that I can''t really get any idea of what may be happening or what you are trying to convey.</td>', 'Looks like there may be a story here, but the entire image comes off to me as so fuzzy and blurry, that I can''t really get any idea of what may be happening or what you are trying to convey.', '2011-05-04 14:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404228, 948760, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog has been hunting the hard way! Grog thanks you for idea. Tribe will be well fed this season, and Grog will have many plump females.</td>', 'Grog has been hunting the hard way! Grog thanks you for idea. Tribe will be well fed this season, and Grog will have many plump females.', '2011-05-04 14:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404244, 948840, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective and the subjects.</td>', 'Love the perspective and the subjects.', '2011-05-04 14:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404259, 948915, 83313, '<td valign="top">"Well, honey, it''s certainly a fixer-upper, but I think we can afford this one on what I make."</td>', '"Well, honey, it''s certainly a fixer-upper, but I think we can afford this one on what I make."', '2011-05-04 15:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404271, 947672, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ooga say Grog not spend enough time with Grog''s younglings. Grog agree to take female youngling on hunt today. Youngling talk much and wear smelly potion. Make good bait for tiger while Grog hide in shrub with spear. Grog is great spender of quality time.</td>', 'Ooga say Grog not spend enough time with Grog''s younglings. Grog agree to take female youngling on hunt today. Youngling talk much and wear smelly potion. Make good bait for tiger while Grog hide in shrub with spear. Grog is great spender of quality time.', '2011-05-04 15:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404393, 945334, 109227, '<td valign="top">Oh, I love this one; playfullness in the woman and seriousness in the dog, lol.  The expressions, lighting and processing are great.  The leg in the bottom left is a little distracting and her hand is a little dark, but overall a great image.</td>', 'Oh, I love this one; playfullness in the woman and seriousness in the dog, lol.  The expressions, lighting and processing are great.  The leg in the bottom left is a little distracting and her hand is a little dark, but overall a great image.', '2011-05-04 18:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404394, 948983, 109227, '<td valign="top">Excellent; I love the tones and dof of field.</td>', 'Excellent; I love the tones and dof of field.', '2011-05-04 18:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404399, 948983, 76335, '<td valign="top">The scene and especially the color make this feel like a movie still.</td>', 'The scene and especially the color make this feel like a movie still.', '2011-05-04 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404405, 949039, 76335, '<td valign="top">A delightful composition.</td>', 'A delightful composition.', '2011-05-04 18:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404407, 949114, 76335, '<td valign="top">Is that the devil himself I see peeking over the horizon?</td>', 'Is that the devil himself I see peeking over the horizon?', '2011-05-04 18:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404409, 948840, 76335, '<td valign="top">Perhaps what it lacks in intrigue is made up by thoughtful composing/arranging of elements. I wonder if a bit more light would have helped.</td>', 'Perhaps what it lacks in intrigue is made up by thoughtful composing/arranging of elements. I wonder if a bit more light would have helped.', '2011-05-04 18:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404410, 948259, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good job with the lighting and exposure. Novel composition.</td>', 'Good job with the lighting and exposure. Novel composition.', '2011-05-04 18:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404413, 948735, 76335, '<td valign="top">An interesting enough scene that could stand on its own. The post processing kind of ruins it for me.</td>', 'An interesting enough scene that could stand on its own. The post processing kind of ruins it for me.', '2011-05-04 18:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404415, 945334, 76335, '<td valign="top">A new twist on film noir. Good.</td>', 'A new twist on film noir. Good.', '2011-05-04 18:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404416, 949143, 76335, '<td valign="top">Looks like a pinwheel with golden springs. Nice.</td>', 'Looks like a pinwheel with golden springs. Nice.', '2011-05-04 18:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404419, 948624, 76335, '<td valign="top">A different kind of blossom tree. A good photo of ugly reality.</td>', 'A different kind of blossom tree. A good photo of ugly reality.', '2011-05-04 18:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404422, 945052, 76335, '<td valign="top">The softness and accidental crop add a voyeuritstic feel to this -- like I''m seeing her through the window of the house next door. Very guilty pleasure.</td>', 'The softness and accidental crop add a voyeuritstic feel to this -- like I''m seeing her through the window of the house next door. Very guilty pleasure.', '2011-05-04 18:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404423, 947899, 76335, '<td valign="top">Challenging lighting, as the highlights are a bit blown in places. Overall it doesn''t take too much from the carefree mood of this.</td>', 'Challenging lighting, as the highlights are a bit blown in places. Overall it doesn''t take too much from the carefree mood of this.', '2011-05-04 18:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404428, 949143, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wonderful macro, well setup by removing the top half of the seeds to get a flat plane to focus on, great PP.</td>', 'Wonderful macro, well setup by removing the top half of the seeds to get a flat plane to focus on, great PP.', '2011-05-04 18:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404429, 949143, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is quite beautiful. Delicate, simple, with mysterious depth. Beautiful.</td>', 'This is quite beautiful. Delicate, simple, with mysterious depth. Beautiful.', '2011-05-04 19:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404451, 948759, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice. Great primary color contrast. Nice misty-water long exposure and nice lines. Could be sharper. Or less sharp. To me it''s in that middle, not sure which way to go, I should have had a tripod stage. No offense! It''s a great photo, but the noise to me indicates you had to use a high ISO, so no tripod. Though the water blur is too blurry to not have stabilized it somehow, as it''s not really that unsharp. I''m confused. It''s a great perspective and the colors are really nice, but these might be some reasons as to why it''s not getting a 7. Not voting, just commenting.</td>', 'Nice. Great primary color contrast. Nice misty-water long exposure and nice lines. Could be sharper. Or less sharp. To me it''s in that middle, not sure which way to go, I should have had a tripod stage. No offense! It''s a great photo, but the noise to me indicates you had to use a high ISO, so no tripod. Though the water blur is too blurry to not have stabilized it somehow, as it''s not really that unsharp. I''m confused. It''s a great perspective and the colors are really nice, but these might be some reasons as to why it''s not getting a 7. Not voting, just commenting.', '2011-05-04 19:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
