(6404546, 948441, 98339, '<td valign="top">this is definitely someplace you want to revisit during the summer when everything is green and alive.  you have such vibrant colors on the bottom 2/3rds of the picture...but the tree line, sky and bank dull this out...that given, you water is superb...</td>', 'this is definitely someplace you want to revisit during the summer when everything is green and alive.  you have such vibrant colors on the bottom 2/3rds of the picture...but the tree line, sky and bank dull this out...that given, you water is superb...', '2011-05-04 22:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
