(6404557, 944943, 98339, '<td valign="top">IMO the size of this hurts the picture. To me when you have a narrow picture a wider border on the top and bottom (only) really balances out the narrowness of the picture...mind you this is only my opinion and overall does not matter...</td>', 'IMO the size of this hurts the picture. To me when you have a narrow picture a wider border on the top and bottom (only) really balances out the narrowness of the picture...mind you this is only my opinion and overall does not matter...', '2011-05-04 22:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404562, 948667, 98339, '<td valign="top">this is a very beautiful horse.  to me looks like an Arabian...but not sure because of the angle of the head in this picture.  it seems like (IMO) that you needed to use more "fill" in this as the horse is slightly shadowed and a fill would have balanced the background with the foreground better.</td>', 'this is a very beautiful horse.  to me looks like an Arabian...but not sure because of the angle of the head in this picture.  it seems like (IMO) that you needed to use more "fill" in this as the horse is slightly shadowed and a fill would have balanced the background with the foreground better.', '2011-05-04 22:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404566, 948919, 98339, '<td valign="top">IMO (which does not count) you are so very far away from your subject (lighthouse) that it is very secondary in this landscape vs focal...it blends with the trees and gets lost</td>', 'IMO (which does not count) you are so very far away from your subject (lighthouse) that it is very secondary in this landscape vs focal...it blends with the trees and gets lost', '2011-05-04 22:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
