(6404766, 948404, 119419, '<td valign="top">lovely skin tone &amp; hair. Nice and simple</td>', 'lovely skin tone & hair. Nice and simple', '2011-05-05 02:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404804, 948834, 94241, '<td valign="top">I like.  Composition great, tone great.  But I have to say the grain/texture in the sky makes me think it''s a painted backdrop like on an old movie set.  It makes it feel closed in instead of open.  The halos around the buildings and clock add to that.</td>', 'I like.  Composition great, tone great.  But I have to say the grain/texture in the sky makes me think it''s a painted backdrop like on an old movie set.  It makes it feel closed in instead of open.  The halos around the buildings and clock add to that.', '2011-05-05 04:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404805, 948951, 94241, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.<br/> <br/>Why so small?</td>', 'Beautiful colors. Why so small?', '2011-05-05 04:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404806, 948798, 94241, '<td valign="top">I think a blurry crowd is cool, it makes it feel like they''re milling about and doing what crowds do.  I think a blurry environment goes a little too far, makes it feel accidental instead of intentional.  Overall interesting shot though.</td>', 'I think a blurry crowd is cool, it makes it feel like they''re milling about and doing what crowds do.  I think a blurry environment goes a little too far, makes it feel accidental instead of intentional.  Overall interesting shot though.', '2011-05-05 04:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404807, 949137, 94241, '<td valign="top">For a musician against a brick wall, it''s great.  The angle is unusual, the focus is as much on his instrument as the model.  One thought: the t-shirt is tonally about the same shade as his skin, I think a darker t-shirt, or no t-shirt at all, may have worked better.  Still, I like.</td>', 'For a musician against a brick wall, it''s great.  The angle is unusual, the focus is as much on his instrument as the model.  One thought: the t-shirt is tonally about the same shade as his skin, I think a darker t-shirt, or no t-shirt at all, may have worked better.  Still, I like.', '2011-05-05 05:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404829, 945760, 108069, '<td valign="top">Fog is always a crowd-pleaser and this is done quite well. Beautiful colors and tones, great composition. Wonderful feel. Nice one.</td>', 'Fog is always a crowd-pleaser and this is done quite well. Beautiful colors and tones, great composition. Wonderful feel. Nice one.', '2011-05-05 07:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404879, 949140, 101668, '<td valign="top">What a magic place. And beautiful picture.</td>', 'What a magic place. And beautiful picture.', '2011-05-05 10:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404882, 947971, 63218, '<td valign="top">I feel like a bee zooming from one flower to the next, looking for the perfect one. Nice combination of soft shadows &amp; intense color. The DOF keeps giving me little visual surprises. The crop  is where real appreciation happens. It causes my eye to travel, finally, from lower L corner to upper R &amp; out of the frame, to come back to the bright spot in the BG &amp; travel in another diagonal to the little bits of grass in the lower R corner. So, yep I love it!</td>', 'I feel like a bee zooming from one flower to the next, looking for the perfect one. Nice combination of soft shadows & intense color. The DOF keeps giving me little visual surprises. The crop  is where real appreciation happens. It causes my eye to travel, finally, from lower L corner to upper R & out of the frame, to come back to the bright spot in the BG & travel in another diagonal to the little bits of grass in the lower R corner. So, yep I love it!', '2011-05-05 10:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404884, 947735, 101668, '<td valign="top">I love photographing these giants and I love this picture. Truly a great shot</td>', 'I love photographing these giants and I love this picture. Truly a great shot', '2011-05-05 10:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404885, 948259, 63218, '<td valign="top">Amazing camera angle that controls the shadows &amp; takes full advantage of some lovely light. The BG bokeh is beautiful. The camera angle &amp; crop  work together to create the illusion that this little dogwood blossom is as big as a golf umbrella, giving me a smile &amp; a nice spring feeling.</td>', 'Amazing camera angle that controls the shadows & takes full advantage of some lovely light. The BG bokeh is beautiful. The camera angle & crop  work together to create the illusion that this little dogwood blossom is as big as a golf umbrella, giving me a smile & a nice spring feeling.', '2011-05-05 10:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404887, 948690, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely work.</td>', 'Lovely work.', '2011-05-05 10:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404892, 948812, 108580, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work except the PP halo around the lower ones bill.</td>', 'Beautiful work except the PP halo around the lower ones bill.', '2011-05-05 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404898, 948843, 63218, '<td valign="top">Oh! Looks like you got a lucky sunbeam there. I appreciate this for having spent some time w/my camera on the ground trying to get a keeper, &amp; the one I entered got a 5.1, a much higher score than I expected. I love this one for the interesting abstract qualities created by the color &amp; light, &amp; for the sharp detail you managed to capture. IMO it''s a difficult subject, in a difficult location (did you get any spider bites?) &amp; often w/difficult light. Good job! I hope yours get a much higher score than mine!<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=915727" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1288/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_915727.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1288/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_915727.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1288/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_915727.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Oh! Looks like you got a lucky sunbeam there. I appreciate this for having spent some time w/my camera on the ground trying to get a keeper, & the one I entered got a 5.1, a much higher score than I expected. I love this one for the interesting abstract qualities created by the color & light, & for the sharp detail you managed to capture. IMO it''s a difficult subject, in a difficult location (did you get any spider bites?) & often w/difficult light. Good job! I hope yours get a much higher score than mine!', '2011-05-05 10:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404899, 948798, 63218, '<td valign="top">This proves the old adage "It''s better to be lucky than good." Of course, you had to also Be There, ready. I can''t tell you how much I admire the Renaissance light in this, the combination of earth colors &amp; primary colors, the feeling of suspended Action. It''s mesmerizing!</td>', 'This proves the old adage "It''s better to be lucky than good." Of course, you had to also Be There, ready. I can''t tell you how much I admire the Renaissance light in this, the combination of earth colors & primary colors, the feeling of suspended Action. It''s mesmerizing!', '2011-05-05 11:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
