(6405479, 948834, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely architecture image with lots to look at and enjoy. Not a single person in sight. Oddly the sky looks very noisy and almost as if it is a painted backdrop a-la a theatre set.</td>', 'Lovely architecture image with lots to look at and enjoy. Not a single person in sight. Oddly the sky looks very noisy and almost as if it is a painted backdrop a-la a theatre set.', '2011-05-06 02:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405480, 949024, 108580, '<td valign="top">Gotta love these shots. The steam era is so emotive and basic. Powerful image. The UWA is odd to control. The loco, whilst distorted, is level, the building is not. Makes for an uneasy lopsided feel to the composition. Sky is very "polluted" the way you processed it. At least an 8.</td>', 'Gotta love these shots. The steam era is so emotive and basic. Powerful image. The UWA is odd to control. The loco, whilst distorted, is level, the building is not. Makes for an uneasy lopsided feel to the composition. Sky is very "polluted" the way you processed it. At least an 8.', '2011-05-06 02:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405483, 948843, 108580, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous study.</td>', 'Gorgeous study.', '2011-05-06 03:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405489, 949083, 108580, '<td valign="top">Superb image. Hope you have a little technique or tutorial on roll-over. It''s interesting, crisp, clean, no noise at this size, lots to look at. You might be getting a few comments about the foreground shrubbery being too much?</td>', 'Superb image. Hope you have a little technique or tutorial on roll-over. It''s interesting, crisp, clean, no noise at this size, lots to look at. You might be getting a few comments about the foreground shrubbery being too much?', '2011-05-06 03:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
