(6405815, 948572, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely POV and UWA shot to include the sign is very clever. I like the 50''s processing (Topaz?) but the halo''s around the wires and trees need better management. I have a few shots if the Monte balloon too. Should be going back to the Bird Gardens soon for another BiF session.</td>', 'Lovely POV and UWA shot to include the sign is very clever. I like the 50''s processing (Topaz?) but the halo''s around the wires and trees need better management. I have a few shots if the Monte balloon too. Should be going back to the Bird Gardens soon for another BiF session.', '2011-05-06 16:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405821, 948905, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like how comfortable he is in this tiny little boat. Great series, BTW. (not voting)</td>', 'I like how comfortable he is in this tiny little boat. Great series, BTW. (not voting)', '2011-05-06 16:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405832, 948624, 66384, '<td valign="top">OMG, what a beautiful scene trashed. There must have been some very high winds. Nice story telling shot.</td>', 'OMG, what a beautiful scene trashed. There must have been some very high winds. Nice story telling shot.', '2011-05-06 17:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405837, 949129, 66384, '<td valign="top">Delicious! Beautiful contrast, and balanced composition. Good job on smoothing the water.</td>', 'Delicious! Beautiful contrast, and balanced composition. Good job on smoothing the water.', '2011-05-06 17:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405839, 948666, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. The processing seems unnecessarily extreme -- I think it would be wonderful without the pumped up detail.</td>', 'Beautiful scene. The processing seems unnecessarily extreme -- I think it would be wonderful without the pumped up detail.', '2011-05-06 17:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405845, 948934, 66384, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary scene, and beautifully photographed. It looks like normal terrain around a lake but ..... nope, that''s not water it''s clouds. I''ve never seen anything like this.</td>', 'Extraordinary scene, and beautifully photographed. It looks like normal terrain around a lake but ..... nope, that''s not water it''s clouds. I''ve never seen anything like this.', '2011-05-06 17:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405848, 948728, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Nice capture of the soft texture.</td>', 'Very cute. Nice capture of the soft texture.', '2011-05-06 17:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405851, 949036, 66384, '<td valign="top">That''s a terrific capture of a beautiful leap. Unfortunately the surrounds are very busy and I think detract from the beauty of the ballerina.</td>', 'That''s a terrific capture of a beautiful leap. Unfortunately the surrounds are very busy and I think detract from the beauty of the ballerina.', '2011-05-06 17:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405852, 949024, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice retro feel to the processing to go along with the subject.</td>', 'Nice retro feel to the processing to go along with the subject.', '2011-05-06 17:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405853, 949050, 66384, '<td valign="top">It seems like a very private moment between the two boats. Lovely scene.</td>', 'It seems like a very private moment between the two boats. Lovely scene.', '2011-05-06 17:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405855, 945582, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene. I think the detail has been pumped up a little too much, with the foreground competing with the lighthouse for attention.</td>', 'Lovely scene. I think the detail has been pumped up a little too much, with the foreground competing with the lighthouse for attention.', '2011-05-06 17:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405856, 946580, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft image for a quiet and soft subject.</td>', 'Lovely soft image for a quiet and soft subject.', '2011-05-06 17:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
