(6405863, 948958, 66384, '<td valign="top">This takes my breath away, it''s so beautiful!</td>', 'This takes my breath away, it''s so beautiful!', '2011-05-06 17:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405870, 949125, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: This images has compelling elements on a number levels. At the centre, a great shadow capture, then outwards an engaging portrait, then outwards we go and we see the wider environment context of the house and then finally comes the rainbow. I like that radial nature of your composition. Most of all though, I like the light.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I think this could be tweaked clockwise just a touch, though perhaps you wanted to avoid the resampling.<br/> <br/>Overall: A great moment to catch - both meterologically and on a human level. Highly interesting.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: This images has compelling elements on a number levels. At the centre, a great shadow capture, then outwards an engaging portrait, then outwards we go and we see the wider environment context of the house and then finally comes the rainbow. I like that radial nature of your composition. Most of all though, I like the light. Critical stuff: I think this could be tweaked clockwise just a touch, though perhaps you wanted to avoid the resampling. Overall: A great moment to catch - both meterologically and on a human level. Highly interesting.', '2011-05-06 18:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405871, 947526, 66384, '<td valign="top">I would love to see those flower field. I think this beautiful image would be even stronger without the road at the bottom. I love the colorful man standing alone in that great expanse of orange.</td>', 'I would love to see those flower field. I think this beautiful image would be even stronger without the road at the bottom. I love the colorful man standing alone in that great expanse of orange.', '2011-05-06 18:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405872, 949083, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clarity and color.</td>', 'Beautiful clarity and color.', '2011-05-06 18:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405877, 945967, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I like unusual portraits and although I''m not sure I like this one (see below), I really admire the work here. Bold as you like subject and composition, I love the POV and how it goes up, up and over the top - almost backwards it seems; without seeming to be distorted. Confounding and slitly amazing. I really like the jaundiced coloration too and of course the story.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: A smoking motif is something I would normally despise, but nonetheless you carry it here.<br/> <br/>Overall: Unusual and effective. Very nice indeed.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I like unusual portraits and although I''m not sure I like this one (see below), I really admire the work here. Bold as you like subject and composition, I love the POV and how it goes up, up and over the top - almost backwards it seems; without seeming to be distorted. Confounding and slitly amazing. I really like the jaundiced coloration too and of course the story. Critical stuff: A smoking motif is something I would normally despise, but nonetheless you carry it here. Overall: Unusual and effective. Very nice indeed.', '2011-05-06 18:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6405879, 948832, 66384, '<td valign="top">Most unusual and intriguing street scene, beautifully captured.</td>', 'Most unusual and intriguing street scene, beautifully captured.', '2011-05-06 18:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
