(6405981, 945432, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a Snowy Egret ... identifying feature is the yellow foot on the black leg. Hard to capture the feather detail on white birds, and you didn''t quite succeed here. Underexposing a little will help with that problem. You can always boost the exposure on the rest of the image in post processing.</td>', 'This is a Snowy Egret ... identifying feature is the yellow foot on the black leg. Hard to capture the feather detail on white birds, and you didn''t quite succeed here. Underexposing a little will help with that problem. You can always boost the exposure on the rest of the image in post processing.', '2011-05-06 20:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
