(6406067, 948624, 97225, '<td valign="top">Oh my. First glance it looks like flowers, then maybe flags. I''ve never seen such a collection of trash caught in trees or scattered on the roadside. Down wind of a trash dump? It''s quite a compelling image.</td>', 'Oh my. First glance it looks like flowers, then maybe flags. I''ve never seen such a collection of trash caught in trees or scattered on the roadside. Down wind of a trash dump? It''s quite a compelling image.', '2011-05-06 21:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
