(6406075, 948972, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful timeless scene. I like the painting effect and the lovely colors. It''s an unusual time of year for the children to be playing in the water (with their winter jackets on). The crop feels a little tight on the bottom. Other than that, its wonderful.</td>', 'Beautiful timeless scene. I like the painting effect and the lovely colors. It''s an unusual time of year for the children to be playing in the water (with their winter jackets on). The crop feels a little tight on the bottom. Other than that, its wonderful.', '2011-05-06 21:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
