(6406130, 949088, 115307, '<td valign="top">This has got to be the best portrait of a Saint Bernard I have ever seen. Granted I have not seen many, but this is still a very lovely pet portrait. The matching hues of the bricks in the background really add that last bit of umph to the picture to make it great. 7</td>', 'This has got to be the best portrait of a Saint Bernard I have ever seen. Granted I have not seen many, but this is still a very lovely pet portrait. The matching hues of the bricks in the background really add that last bit of umph to the picture to make it great. 7', '2011-05-06 22:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406131, 948801, 130760, '<td valign="top">WOOOOWW!!!</td>', 'WOOOOWW!!!', '2011-05-06 22:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406133, 945334, 115307, '<td valign="top">The dog is better lit than the woman, which is too bad. I would have liked to see more light on her face. Nevertheless a really great and really interesting portrait. I am giving this an 8</td>', 'The dog is better lit than the woman, which is too bad. I would have liked to see more light on her face. Nevertheless a really great and really interesting portrait. I am giving this an 8', '2011-05-06 22:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
