(6406135, 948026, 115307, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sunset and wonderfully textured rocks. The weird spurt of water on the right side is too distracting and makes the difference for me between a 7 and a 9. 7</td>', 'Gorgeous sunset and wonderfully textured rocks. The weird spurt of water on the right side is too distracting and makes the difference for me between a 7 and a 9. 7', '2011-05-06 22:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406136, 948803, 115307, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, her eyes really tell a story. I feel like the portrait world is overrun with pretty but lifeless eyes. This one is a great exception to that rule. 8</td>', 'Great portrait, her eyes really tell a story. I feel like the portrait world is overrun with pretty but lifeless eyes. This one is a great exception to that rule. 8', '2011-05-06 22:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406137, 945384, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is a really awesome picture. Good eye. I would love to see a comparison between this picture, and one where the wires above are edited out. They do not bother me here, but I am curious whether the removal would make the picture stronger or weaker. Obviously not legal in the editing for this challenge though.<br/>Anyways, awesome work. I do hope this gets its just admiration from the masses. 8</td>', 'This is a really awesome picture. Good eye. I would love to see a comparison between this picture, and one where the wires above are edited out. They do not bother me here, but I am curious whether the removal would make the picture stronger or weaker. Obviously not legal in the editing for this challenge though.Anyways, awesome work. I do hope this gets its just admiration from the masses. 8', '2011-05-06 22:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406139, 947671, 115307, '<td valign="top">Love the editing done on this. It is very effective. It definitely makes me feel like I am being closely watched and that I am being evaluated on whether I would make a good meal or not. 8</td>', 'Love the editing done on this. It is very effective. It definitely makes me feel like I am being closely watched and that I am being evaluated on whether I would make a good meal or not. 8', '2011-05-06 22:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406140, 945802, 115307, '<td valign="top">njsabs? I am guessing by the background and general editing style.<br/>Either way, I am totally floored by this picture. By far the best portrait I have seen in this challenge so far, and one of the best I have seen in a long time. Those eyes are just so soulful and tell such a story. What a gorgeous little girl. A 10 and a fav</td>', 'njsabs? I am guessing by the background and general editing style.Either way, I am totally floored by this picture. By far the best portrait I have seen in this challenge so far, and one of the best I have seen in a long time. Those eyes are just so soulful and tell such a story. What a gorgeous little girl. A 10 and a fav', '2011-05-06 22:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
