(6406250, 949141, 38930, '<td valign="top">nice idea! Some suggestions: I would try to clean up some of the sensor dust around the top, and then add some contrast. Also, if the tree in the center is the point of your photo, try getting a little closer so it fills up more of the photo. This looks like a great spot to take photos!</td>', 'nice idea! Some suggestions: I would try to clean up some of the sensor dust around the top, and then add some contrast. Also, if the tree in the center is the point of your photo, try getting a little closer so it fills up more of the photo. This looks like a great spot to take photos!', '2011-05-07 00:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
