(6406256, 947334, 39057, '<td valign="top">I have to say...I hate water drops because they are so overdone here on DPC. However, this one stands alone so I won''t lower your score by 1 ( for an over done image). 9 from me.</td>', 'I have to say...I hate water drops because they are so overdone here on DPC. However, this one stands alone so I won''t lower your score by 1 ( for an over done image). 9 from me.', '2011-05-07 01:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
