(6406446, 948732, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Fabulous POV and composition and that reflected sunlight is the icing on the cake. I really enjoy that focus on the underside of the walkway and the texture so revealed. The relatively low contrast and toning is perfectly judged.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing<br/> <br/>Overall: Standout composition and well chosen POV turns what might have been just a shot of a building into something fantastic.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Fabulous POV and composition and that reflected sunlight is the icing on the cake. I really enjoy that focus on the underside of the walkway and the texture so revealed. The relatively low contrast and toning is perfectly judged. Critical stuff: Nothing Overall: Standout composition and well chosen POV turns what might have been just a shot of a building into something fantastic.', '2011-05-07 11:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406448, 948735, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like the presentation of symbolism. I''m not certain what was originally implied by the sign, but it''s associated aging structure mirrors the emptiness (time) of the foreground. Passage of time is seen in the broken shafts of grass. Although I don''t like the halo around the building, overall, I like your choice of processing. 9</td>', 'I like the presentation of symbolism. I''m not certain what was originally implied by the sign, but it''s associated aging structure mirrors the emptiness (time) of the foreground. Passage of time is seen in the broken shafts of grass. Although I don''t like the halo around the building, overall, I like your choice of processing. 9', '2011-05-07 11:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
