(6406450, 949088, 98022, '<td valign="top">Very nice dog portrait. Great job with the lighting and the textures in the white fur. DOF is just right. Only nit-pick is the tilt of the photo - wish you had straightened it so the wall morter lines were horizontal.</td>', 'Very nice dog portrait. Great job with the lighting and the textures in the white fur. DOF is just right. Only nit-pick is the tilt of the photo - wish you had straightened it so the wall morter lines were horizontal.', '2011-05-07 11:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
