(6406470, 949142, 76335, '<td valign="top">I do like tulips, or any colorful flower, in black and white. A few quibbles: I wonder if a different filter (either physical or in post) would have given the flowers some better, more defining contrast. Also, this feels very unlevel which is distracting. Otherwise, nice.</td>', 'I do like tulips, or any colorful flower, in black and white. A few quibbles: I wonder if a different filter (either physical or in post) would have given the flowers some better, more defining contrast. Also, this feels very unlevel which is distracting. Otherwise, nice.', '2011-05-07 12:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
