(6406482, 949086, 11769, '<td valign="top">That''s about right, you can''t take a leak and they put a water fountain there for the insult of it all.</td>', 'That''s about right, you can''t take a leak and they put a water fountain there for the insult of it all.', '2011-05-07 12:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
