(6406484, 948905, 11769, '<td valign="top">The scarf covered face under that conical Asian hat presents a scene without human interference. The shapes reign here and they are presented with elegance and sensitivity. To me an alien world, one of painful beauty and eternal life.</td>', 'The scarf covered face under that conical Asian hat presents a scene without human interference. The shapes reign here and they are presented with elegance and sensitivity. To me an alien world, one of painful beauty and eternal life.', '2011-05-07 12:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406491, 948861, 76335, '<td valign="top">I do like the singularity of that cloud -- the way it dominates the landscape, and, with its reflection, seems to contain it.</td>', 'I do like the singularity of that cloud -- the way it dominates the landscape, and, with its reflection, seems to contain it.', '2011-05-07 12:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406493, 947703, 76335, '<td valign="top">Model looks ill-at-ease. Whatever she''s anticipating can''t be good.</td>', 'Model looks ill-at-ease. Whatever she''s anticipating can''t be good.', '2011-05-07 12:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406503, 947642, 76335, '<td valign="top">Astounding. The framing is perfect -- being closer or farther away would have been at the cost of some impact. Color would have been gratuitous. Really, it almost feels manufactured. That''s not a criticism, but more a statement of disbelief that you could bring together so many details in a portrait -- and there are a LOT of them -- to tell your subject''s story: The reflective, slightly crooked glasses, the sloppy shave, the plaid shirt, the unexpected single earring, the unruly wisps of hair, the hat whose textures complement (or do they contrast with?) his weathered skin and whose brim draws a saddle curve of an orbit around his whole face. <br/> <br/>But it''s that nervous and tight half-grin that''s the icing on the cake. For all that this portrait reveals about your subject, he seems to be trying still to hold a little something back. It''s in vain, of course, but I''m not sure he knows it. And therein lies the great irony, the rewarding impact, of this wonderful character study.</td>', 'Astounding. The framing is perfect -- being closer or farther away would have been at the cost of some impact. Color would have been gratuitous. Really, it almost feels manufactured. That''s not a criticism, but more a statement of disbelief that you could bring together so many details in a portrait -- and there are a LOT of them -- to tell your subject''s story: The reflective, slightly crooked glasses, the sloppy shave, the plaid shirt, the unexpected single earring, the unruly wisps of hair, the hat whose textures complement (or do they contrast with?) his weathered skin and whose brim draws a saddle curve of an orbit around his whole face.  But it''s that nervous and tight half-grin that''s the icing on the cake. For all that this portrait reveals about your subject, he seems to be trying still to hold a little something back. It''s in vain, of course, but I''m not sure he knows it. And therein lies the great irony, the rewarding impact, of this wonderful character study.', '2011-05-07 13:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406505, 948333, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. Full of good humor.</td>', 'Nicely composed. Full of good humor.', '2011-05-07 13:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406509, 949100, 76335, '<td valign="top">Crop''s a bit tight on the right. Title is unnecessary. An angle that showed off the gentleman''s warm smile a bit more would have been nice. But I suspect this was a casual sort of snap, and I''m probably nitpicking. The warmth of the moment holds up just fine.</td>', 'Crop''s a bit tight on the right. Title is unnecessary. An angle that showed off the gentleman''s warm smile a bit more would have been nice. But I suspect this was a casual sort of snap, and I''m probably nitpicking. The warmth of the moment holds up just fine.', '2011-05-07 13:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406510, 945967, 76335, '<td valign="top">The things we do in our attics... I like it.</td>', 'The things we do in our attics... I like it.', '2011-05-07 13:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406512, 947197, 76335, '<td valign="top">The light in the hair is a bit hot. Overall, it''s warm and honest and very nice in black and white.</td>', 'The light in the hair is a bit hot. Overall, it''s warm and honest and very nice in black and white.', '2011-05-07 13:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406516, 947670, 76335, '<td valign="top">At first glance, a simply stated composition. But as the mind get to work on the elements here, the story comes together.</td>', 'At first glance, a simply stated composition. But as the mind get to work on the elements here, the story comes together.', '2011-05-07 13:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
