(6406593, 948983, 30364, '<td valign="top">Superb, in spite of some slightly weird (and pointless, if they were intentional) colour casts in places.  Wonderful connection between the two main players.  Thank you.</td>', 'Superb, in spite of some slightly weird (and pointless, if they were intentional) colour casts in places.  Wonderful connection between the two main players.  Thank you.', '2011-05-07 15:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
