(6406595, 947670, 83313, '<td valign="top">A well composed shot and the title tells me the story that goes with it, but it comes off to me a touch flat looking. Seems to need a little more visual oomph to me. Not sure exactly what, though.</td>', 'A well composed shot and the title tells me the story that goes with it, but it comes off to me a touch flat looking. Seems to need a little more visual oomph to me. Not sure exactly what, though.', '2011-05-07 15:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406596, 949120, 30364, '<td valign="top">So much better than it looks (if you''ll forgive the backhanded compliment).  It''s a terrific picture, and in my top three.  Thank you.</td>', 'So much better than it looks (if you''ll forgive the backhanded compliment).  It''s a terrific picture, and in my top three.  Thank you.', '2011-05-07 15:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
