(6406603, 948664, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog brings home new pet. Bird tells many stories and is liked by Grog''s younglings. Reminds Grog of Grog''s favorite female, but bird gives better advice.</td>', 'Grog brings home new pet. Bird tells many stories and is liked by Grog''s younglings. Reminds Grog of Grog''s favorite female, but bird gives better advice.', '2011-05-07 15:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406604, 947341, 83313, '<td valign="top">Overall, I like this, though the the graininess in the sky does not come off well to me. Not sure if that was an intentional look, or if it just needed some noise reduction.</td>', 'Overall, I like this, though the the graininess in the sky does not come off well to me. Not sure if that was an intentional look, or if it just needed some noise reduction.', '2011-05-07 15:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406605, 948271, 83313, '<td valign="top">He looks sad.</td>', 'He looks sad.', '2011-05-07 15:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406606, 948972, 30364, '<td valign="top">My top pick in this challenge.  It''s fairly easy to take a decent seashore picture, but it''s surprisingly difficult to take a really good one.  This is a <i>really </i>good one, in the class of Magnum photographer Harry Gruyaert''s glorious <a href="//www.magnumphotos.com/c.aspx?VP=XSpecific_MAG.StoryDetail_VPage&amp;pid=2TYRYDDWUYMQ" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Rivages</a> series.  Beautiful work.  10.  Thank you.</td>', 'My top pick in this challenge.  It''s fairly easy to take a decent seashore picture, but it''s surprisingly difficult to take a really good one.  This is a really good one, in the class of Magnum photographer Harry Gruyaert''s glorious Rivages series.  Beautiful work.  10.  Thank you.', '2011-05-07 15:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6406607, 948898, 83313, '<td valign="top">There is something going on here that I am not understanding, but I think I am supposed to get it. She does not look terribly enthused, and the bottle of booze in the foreground adds some question as to what is going on.</td>', 'There is something going on here that I am not understanding, but I think I am supposed to get it. She does not look terribly enthused, and the bottle of booze in the foreground adds some question as to what is going on.', '2011-05-07 15:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
