(6407094, 945334, 121949, '<td valign="top">Wahoo! A ribbon and in a free study! When you do it you do it with style. You kept so quiet all week about this. How exciting. It was a great photo, I wish Robert hadn''t spilled the beans on it,d I would have liked to have voted on it.</td>', 'Wahoo! A ribbon and in a free study! When you do it you do it with style. You kept so quiet all week about this. How exciting. It was a great photo, I wish Robert hadn''t spilled the beans on it,d I would have liked to have voted on it.', '2011-05-08 01:07:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6407095, 945334, 30861, '<td valign="top">How about that! A 7, your first 7, and a ribbon, your first ribbon! Maybe some of the mojo''ll rub off on me in Carmel :-) Congrats!</td>', 'How about that! A 7, your first 7, and a ribbon, your first ribbon! Maybe some of the mojo''ll rub off on me in Carmel :-) Congrats!', '2011-05-08 01:07:44.000000', NULL, 0),
