(6407097, 948690, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is phenomenal light, beautifully rendered. You and Tanguera both got first ribbons, and both in a Free Study! WTG!</td>', 'This is phenomenal light, beautifully rendered. You and Tanguera both got first ribbons, and both in a Free Study! WTG!', '2011-05-08 01:08:35.000000', NULL, 0),
