(6407099, 945334, 112972, '<td valign="top">YES!  It could not have happened to a more deserving person!  Huge congrats on your first ribbon and hoping to see many more from you in the future!</td>', 'YES!  It could not have happened to a more deserving person!  Huge congrats on your first ribbon and hoping to see many more from you in the future!', '2011-05-08 01:09:17.000000', NULL, 0),
