(6407246, 949114, 93565, '<td valign="top">Wow, I never would''ve expected this to be your entry, Joe! (other than the whole Florida connection)<br/>All I mean by that is I didn''t really think it was in your style at all. In any case, very nice, and I''m glad you got some recognition in the comments, since this isn''t the sort of thing that scores well in a FS.<br/>The textures in the sky are very surprising and cool, almost look like an overlay.</td>', 'Wow, I never would''ve expected this to be your entry, Joe! (other than the whole Florida connection)All I mean by that is I didn''t really think it was in your style at all. In any case, very nice, and I''m glad you got some recognition in the comments, since this isn''t the sort of thing that scores well in a FS.The textures in the sky are very surprising and cool, almost look like an overlay.', '2011-05-08 03:07:23.000000', NULL, 0),
