(6407379, 949125, 37648, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments guys, much appreciated. <br/>After seeing a huge rainbow outside my house window, I gathered up my brother and his girlfriend for this shot. They didn''t have time to change into any fancy clothing, it was a cold day hence why they are wearing what they are. <br/>Perhaps I could have got them to pose differently for this shot changing the dynamics of the photo to make it more interesting.<br/>Leaving for Canada in a weeks time, going to miss home!</td>', 'Thanks for the comments guys, much appreciated. After seeing a huge rainbow outside my house window, I gathered up my brother and his girlfriend for this shot. They didn''t have time to change into any fancy clothing, it was a cold day hence why they are wearing what they are. Perhaps I could have got them to pose differently for this shot changing the dynamics of the photo to make it more interesting.Leaving for Canada in a weeks time, going to miss home!', '2011-05-08 09:17:56.000000', NULL, 0),
