(6407629, 947735, 20799, '<td valign="top">I wish I had horizons like this one around here. Derek, I love this, its cleanliness and simplicity. Composition is truly wonderful and I love how the red sunset, joining the magenta from the field, draws my view toward infinity. Playing with color, with such great result.</td>', 'I wish I had horizons like this one around here. Derek, I love this, its cleanliness and simplicity. Composition is truly wonderful and I love how the red sunset, joining the magenta from the field, draws my view toward infinity. Playing with color, with such great result.', '2011-05-08 14:32:47.000000', NULL, 0),
