(6407645, 949144, 66384, '<td valign="top">Ha ha, I suspected this was <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a>''s. Very nice. Congrats on the Posthumous Award.</td>', 'Ha ha, I suspected this was  Melethia''s. Very nice. Congrats on the Posthumous Award.', '2011-05-08 15:06:03.000000', NULL, 0),
