(6407703, 947735, 104009, '<td valign="top">the color of the field is magnificent. not sure i would call it magenta i think of it as more of a dark lilac?  i just know it''s really beautiful.  the way the eye is drawn to the contrast of colors is perfect.</td>', 'the color of the field is magnificent. not sure i would call it magenta i think of it as more of a dark lilac?  i just know it''s really beautiful.  the way the eye is drawn to the contrast of colors is perfect.', '2011-05-08 16:31:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6407704, 949143, 108580, '<td valign="top">Superb macro as mentioned earlier. What a great eye you have for macro images. Last 3 Challenges and your missing a ribbon by the narrowest of margins. Keep it up. Your work has made me look at that Tokina AF 100mm f/2.8 Macro AT-X M100 Pro D for Nikon coupled with the D80 and it''s super CCD. 10.</td>', 'Superb macro as mentioned earlier. What a great eye you have for macro images. Last 3 Challenges and your missing a ribbon by the narrowest of margins. Keep it up. Your work has made me look at that Tokina AF 100mm f/2.8 Macro AT-X M100 Pro D for Nikon coupled with the D80 and it''s super CCD. 10.', '2011-05-08 16:31:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(6407709, 948736, 104009, '<td valign="top">the trees make this for me.  definitely outside of your box, and most others.  <br/> <br/>i like that you''re willing to take a chance with an entry. seeing as you''re a photographer with the ability to easily appeal to the mainstream dpc crowd, yet tries something new, is inspirational to me.</td>', 'the trees make this for me.  definitely outside of your box, and most others.   i like that you''re willing to take a chance with an entry. seeing as you''re a photographer with the ability to easily appeal to the mainstream dpc crowd, yet tries something new, is inspirational to me.', '2011-05-08 16:35:18.000000', NULL, 0),
