(6407794, 948974, 19825, '<td valign="top">I was going through the Free Study results and I had to stop at this one and let you know what a beautiful image this is. During scoring this was my favorite image of the challenge -- it should have placed higher. My wife was just walking by and stopped and said, "Oooooo... I love that one! I would think about buying a print of that and putting it on our wall." She is an interior designer -- she does not say that often. So, if it were only up to my wife and me, we would have given you the blue. Nice job.</td>', 'I was going through the Free Study results and I had to stop at this one and let you know what a beautiful image this is. During scoring this was my favorite image of the challenge -- it should have placed higher. My wife was just walking by and stopped and said, "Oooooo... I love that one! I would think about buying a print of that and putting it on our wall." She is an interior designer -- she does not say that often. So, if it were only up to my wife and me, we would have given you the blue. Nice job.', '2011-05-08 18:40:19.000000', NULL, 0),
