(6408015, 947450, 71657, '<td valign="top">He told me, but I didn''t believe it.  You should have started a thread and asked for suggestions, but, oh you probably did.  Was this with iphone?  lol.  Well, at least you can say you have a ribbon now... one more than Kenny and I have.  At least you entered something.  Good job.  Hoping you do better next time.  Just remember, as long as you like it, that''s all that counts.</td>', 'He told me, but I didn''t believe it.  You should have started a thread and asked for suggestions, but, oh you probably did.  Was this with iphone?  lol.  Well, at least you can say you have a ribbon now... one more than Kenny and I have.  At least you entered something.  Good job.  Hoping you do better next time.  Just remember, as long as you like it, that''s all that counts.', '2011-05-09 00:29:22.000000', NULL, 0),
