(6408835, 947334, 90495, '<td valign="top">Dumb people who vote 1, 2, 3 and 4 just because it''s a water drop. They just do not realise how difficult it is to get a shot like this. <br/> <br/>Voters like Kenskid, who take away points for shots like this one should be forced to come up with a similar image just so they understand what it takes to capture this. <br/> <br/>Great capture and well done. I always give 9s or 10s on these shots because I know they get hit by the whiners who can''t do this photography.</td>', 'Dumb people who vote 1, 2, 3 and 4 just because it''s a water drop. They just do not realise how difficult it is to get a shot like this.  Voters like Kenskid, who take away points for shots like this one should be forced to come up with a similar image just so they understand what it takes to capture this.  Great capture and well done. I always give 9s or 10s on these shots because I know they get hit by the whiners who can''t do this photography.', '2011-05-09 18:25:29.000000', NULL, 0),
