(6413628, 947754, 101356, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured.  I love, as others, the expression on her face and also the ''expression'' from her fingers.  The line of her arm along with the direction of her gaze is engaging.  Use of B&amp;W enhances the effect.  Very nice.</td>', 'Beautifully captured.  I love, as others, the expression on her face and also the ''expression'' from her fingers.  The line of her arm along with the direction of her gaze is engaging.  Use of B&W enhances the effect.  Very nice.', '2011-05-14 17:29:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6413650, 948690, 86447, '<td valign="top">You have captured something very beautifully here!  Congrats on your first ribbon!  And, on having such wonderful friends.<br/> <br/>You can certainly brag about this image.   It''s perfect.<br/></td>', 'You have captured something very beautifully here!  Congrats on your first ribbon!  And, on having such wonderful friends. You can certainly brag about this image.   It''s perfect.', '2011-05-14 18:51:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6415910, 948313, 117474, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what to say about this other than 6.2 for a portrait in a free study--nice work! The border here is excellent. I don''t think it hurts the image at all. It ''really tied the room together'' as a dude once said. <br/> <br/>The only criticism I can draw from this image is to do with the lighting. Mostly I think it''s excellent. But there''s a dark shadow of her right ear on her face. It''s hard to say, but I think that was that not there it would have worked better. Just a small thing that I doubt would be greatly noticed at all. I think it would have been nice to see how her hair falls there is all. <br/> <br/>Great portrait though. Great processing and capture and lighting.</td>', 'I''m not sure what to say about this other than 6.2 for a portrait in a free study--nice work! The border here is excellent. I don''t think it hurts the image at all. It ''really tied the room together'' as a dude once said.  The only criticism I can draw from this image is to do with the lighting. Mostly I think it''s excellent. But there''s a dark shadow of her right ear on her face. It''s hard to say, but I think that was that not there it would have worked better. Just a small thing that I doubt would be greatly noticed at all. I think it would have been nice to see how her hair falls there is all.  Great portrait though. Great processing and capture and lighting.', '2011-05-17 14:50:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6415984, 948313, 131216, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I do think making the border all black may help.</td>', 'Great shot! I do think making the border all black may help.', '2011-05-17 17:11:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6416541, 946686, 67258, '<td valign="top">You had a pretty successful holiday! Just the right amount of blur in the water, so that a sense of movement is retained.</td>', 'You had a pretty successful holiday! Just the right amount of blur in the water, so that a sense of movement is retained.', '2011-05-18 02:46:37.000000', NULL, 0),
