(6417933, 949114, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  I love the way the sky looks - like a texture brush went running rampant.  The sprig of flames is an interesting contrast to the rest of the background.</td>', 'Very cool.  I love the way the sky looks - like a texture brush went running rampant.  The sprig of flames is an interesting contrast to the rest of the background.', '2011-05-18 23:36:05.000000', NULL, 0),
