(6478727, 947642, 12611, '<td valign="top">You have some great portraits, and this is particularly nice, perhaps in its lighthearted unconventionality. Love the dead on look and the tight crop. Something fantastic about high contrast black and white western/ranch shots. they have just such a great modern yet rustic feel. great work.</td>', 'You have some great portraits, and this is particularly nice, perhaps in its lighthearted unconventionality. Love the dead on look and the tight crop. Something fantastic about high contrast black and white western/ranch shots. they have just such a great modern yet rustic feel. great work.', '2011-07-22 10:48:40.000000', NULL, 0),
