(6651303, 949134, 27812, '<td valign="top">More than a bit of myself in this image; aged, bent and broken n time yet clinging to life being lived around it. Tenacity, even in death. A very good image, well ''preserved'' for those who will allow themselves the time to be still and just observe the scene, watch and see. There is much to be seen.<br/>Sadly, just another reminder that we do not spend enough time looking at images when voting. I gave it a 6, now I wonder why it did not get an 8 from me.</td>', 'More than a bit of myself in this image; aged, bent and broken n time yet clinging to life being lived around it. Tenacity, even in death. A very good image, well ''preserved'' for those who will allow themselves the time to be still and just observe the scene, watch and see. There is much to be seen.Sadly, just another reminder that we do not spend enough time looking at images when voting. I gave it a 6, now I wonder why it did not get an 8 from me.', '2012-01-21 11:49:55.000000', NULL, 0),
