(6666451, 948905, 49018, '<td valign="top">Charon approaches, and that''s nothing to be scared of..<br/> <br/>"The scarf covered face under that conical Asian hat presents a scene without human interference. The shapes reign here and they are presented with elegance and sensitivity. To me an alien world, one of painful beauty and eternal life."<br/> <br/>No human interference.. That''s actually one of the nicest comments I have read..</td>', 'Charon approaches, and that''s nothing to be scared of.. "The scarf covered face under that conical Asian hat presents a scene without human interference. The shapes reign here and they are presented with elegance and sensitivity. To me an alien world, one of painful beauty and eternal life." No human interference.. That''s actually one of the nicest comments I have read..', '2012-02-07 17:45:17.000000', NULL, 0),
