(6940723, 948660, 136989, '<td valign="top">The dogwood is one of my favorite trees/flowers.  The trees are so alive with color (and bees).  This is a unique perspective (from behind the flower) and I just love how it all comes together.</td>', 'The dogwood is one of my favorite trees/flowers.  The trees are so alive with color (and bees).  This is a unique perspective (from behind the flower) and I just love how it all comes together.', '2012-12-23 13:34:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6949593, 947642, 140305, '<td valign="top">I have to agree with your idea about the smile. It almost seems like he just told a joke and now he is waiting for the reaction of the listeners. This photo reminds me the time I visited Dallas/Ft Worth (way back in 1997). We went to the stockyards because my brother really wanted to see it. We all ended up at a huge bar called Billy Bobs where we actually got to see an indoor rodeo -in the bar!! (only in Texas ey?) It was huge fun. Seems to me there were a few of this type hanging out that evening LOL. Great shot.</td>', 'I have to agree with your idea about the smile. It almost seems like he just told a joke and now he is waiting for the reaction of the listeners. This photo reminds me the time I visited Dallas/Ft Worth (way back in 1997). We went to the stockyards because my brother really wanted to see it. We all ended up at a huge bar called Billy Bobs where we actually got to see an indoor rodeo -in the bar!! (only in Texas ey?) It was huge fun. Seems to me there were a few of this type hanging out that evening LOL. Great shot.', '2013-01-05 12:28:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6949876, 947642, 83313, '<td valign="top">I ran into this guy in almost the same spot a year later. He didn''t remember me, but since I called him by name, he''d obviously met me before. I did have this photo on my phone to show him how well it turned out.</td>', 'I ran into this guy in almost the same spot a year later. He didn''t remember me, but since I called him by name, he''d obviously met me before. I did have this photo on my phone to show him how well it turned out.', '2013-01-05 18:04:55.000000', NULL, 0),
